{"data":[{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1563862154289336322","created_at":"2022-08-28T12:12:47.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1563862154289336322"],"id":"1563862154289336322","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":9,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":0,"retweet_count":0},"text":"为什么开心那么难 难过却这么简单\n今天早上被我软磨硬泡还是操操了\n溢于言表的满足感 尽管只睡了三个小时但是也很满足很满足\n送我到高铁站之后我就跟丢了魂一样\n进站以为自己没拿身份证\n到学校之后骑车没骑稳把自己脚划破好大一片 连带着脚踝都有点肿\n本来收拾好的心情就这么一点一点被打破","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1563862154289336322"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1563339356458590209","created_at":"2022-08-27T01:35:22.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1563339356458590209"],"id":"1563339356458590209","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":4,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"明天开学（心情不好）➡️开学前一天过夜（心情好）➡️今天早上来姨妈（天崩地裂）\n上帝说：“小猫啊，请尽情享受你的禁欲生活吧😈”","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1563339356458590209"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1562450814727487491","created_at":"2022-08-24T14:44:37.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1562450814727487491"],"id":"1562450814727487491","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":5,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":2,"retweet_count":0},"text":"老子有家有男人\n流浪个锤子 晦不晦气😤 https://t.co/DTnl1rAgyR","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1562450814727487491"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1562413707484975104","created_at":"2022-08-24T12:17:10.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["1562413707484975104"],"id":"1562413707484975104","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":0,"impression_count":0,"like_count":2,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":1,"retweet_count":0},"text":"好焦虑啊……\n我真的需要上学吗……\n🤧🤧🤧🤧🤧🤧🤧","url":"https://x.com/Six_One61_/status/1562413707484975104"},{"author_id":"1518626636476092417","conversation_id":"1561733475769671682","created_at":"2022-08-22T15:14:10.000Z","edi